# Shadow of the Goblin's "Whenever you play a land or cast a spell from anywhere other than your hand" is only for its controller's lands
# and spells. On turn 2 Bot2, who does not control Shadow, casts Faithless Looting by flashback from its graveyard and plays an Island from its
# graveyard with Crucible of Worlds: neither triggers Bot1's Shadow, so nobody takes damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Shadow of the Goblin
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Gleemox
Black Lotus
Faithless Looting
Crucible of Worlds
Island x13

